  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a data-mce-href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a39a941cebdb43369854b46bea2b0f75/BT1.6_Socket_Head_Cap_Self_Tapping_Screw_SHCS.pdf\" data-mce-style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a39a941cebdb43369854b46bea2b0f75/BT1.6_Socket_Head_Cap_Self_Tapping_Screw_SHCS.pdf\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"2D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/1ed6b71b4c814ac3bc34933673003555/2d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> Specification </a> <a data-mce-href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/f9748e086a634f8b972733eee4374154/BT1.6_SHCS_Self_Tapping_Screw.zip\" data-mce-style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/f9748e086a634f8b972733eee4374154/BT1.6_SHCS_Self_Tapping_Screw.zip\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>L (mm)\n<p>Bolt Length</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>D (mm)</div>\n<p>Head Diameter</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>H (mm)</div>\n<p>Head Thickness</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>k (mm)</div>\n<p>Hexagon Across Flats</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>t (mm)</div>\n<p>Groove Depth</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Screwdriver Bit <br/>Size</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">AA092</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">6</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">1.5</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">1.5</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">1.0</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">H1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<p data-mce-style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\">Forgot the screw specs? <span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"> Just tap the <strong><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/14860#profileId-14641\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-style=\"color: #00ae42;\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><u>Screw Gauge</u></span></span></a> </strong>for sorting help.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Self-Tapping Screws for 3D Printing</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p>For 3D printed parts, which often have gaps between layers and varying hole sizes, we recommend using BT self-tapping screws. These screws provide moderate torque for insertion, prevent loosening, and can be installed and removed multiple times. Using these screws and matching them with the recommended hole size ensures easy and secure connections for your printed parts, eliminating the need for nuts and avoiding issues like screw loosening or hole shrinkage.</p>\n<br/>\n<p>We have included the relevant data for the twisting torque and loosening torque experiments of PLA and PETG material specimens, as well as the recommended hole sizes for design. The model files for testing are available for download at the end of the details page. All test holes are printed perpendicularly to the platform. When designing a bolt bottom hole on the side of the part, it is recommended to use a size one size larger than the recommended size for lying flat to prevent interlayer compression cracking.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/7cf43ab23cc6429fb561dfe5b430826d/Test_Data_for_Self-Tapping_Screws.png\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <svg class=\"download_svg\" fill=\"none\" height=\"65\" viewbox=\"0 0 55 65\" width=\"55\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M37.7155 0.802246L55.0002 16.8009V63.3224C55.0002 64.1367 54.34 64.7969 53.5256 64.7969H5.16103C4.34667 64.7969 3.6865 64.1367 3.6865 63.3224V2.27677C3.6865 1.46241 4.34667 0.802246 5.16103 0.802246H37.7155Z\" fill=\"#DF322F\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path> <path d=\"M5.89828 4.48869C5.89828 3.67433 6.55845 3.01416 7.37281 3.01416H36.5375C36.9345 3.01416 37.3147 3.17423 37.5922 3.45817L44.4344 10.4605L52.2569 16.9683C52.5936 17.2485 52.7884 17.6638 52.7884 18.1019V61.1107C52.7884 61.925 52.1282 62.5852 51.3138 62.5852H7.37281C6.55845 62.5852 5.89828 61.925 5.89828 61.1107V4.48869Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> <rect fill=\"#DF322F\" height=\"23.5925\" rx=\"1.47453\" width=\"45.563\" x=\"0.000193596\" y=\"24.3948\"></rect> <path d=\"M12.9688 31.164